# UBITS Playground - Cursor AI Rules

## 🚨 MANDATORY: UBITS VALIDATION SYSTEM

**BEFORE creating ANY component, style, or UI element:**

1. ✅ **ALWAYS** check `.ubits/component-inventory.json` for existing components
2. ✅ **NEVER** create custom components when official ones exist
3. ✅ **ALWAYS** use UBITS tokens (`var(--ubits-*)`) - NEVER hardcoded colors
4. ✅ **ALWAYS** use official UBITS typography classes (see `.ubits/component-inventory.json` → `tokens.typography.validClasses`)
5. ✅ **ALWAYS** import component CSS when using components

## 📋 COMPONENT INVENTORY

**Location:** `.ubits/component-inventory.json`

**Before creating ANY UI element, check this file first!**

### Available Components:
- `button` - Button component with variants (primary, secondary, tertiary)
- `badge` - Badge component with variants (dot, number)
- `alert` - Alert component with variants (info, success, warning, error)
- `toast` - Toast notifications with auto-close
- `input` - Input component with 11 types (text, email, password, etc.)
- `list` - List component with selection
- `sidebar` - Sidebar navigation
- `subnav` - Sub-navigation tabs
- `tabbar` - Mobile tab bar
- `card-content` - Content cards

**If you need to create a component that's not in the inventory:**
1. Create it as a new add-on in `packages/addons/[name]/`
2. **IMMEDIATELY** update `.ubits/component-inventory.json`
3. Follow the structure of existing components

## 🎨 TOKENS UBITS

### Colors:
- ✅ `var(--ubits-fg-*)` - Text colors
- ✅ `var(--ubits-bg-*)` - Background colors
- ✅ `var(--ubits-border-*)` - Border colors
- ✅ `var(--ubits-accent-*)` - Accent colors
- ✅ `var(--ubits-feedback-*)` - Feedback colors

### Typography Classes (ONLY THESE EXIST):
**Display:**
- `ubits-display-d1-regular`, `ubits-display-d1-semibold`, `ubits-display-d1-bold`
- `ubits-display-d2-regular`, `ubits-display-d2-semibold`, `ubits-display-d2-bold`
- `ubits-display-d3-regular`, `ubits-display-d3-semibold`, `ubits-display-d3-bold`
- `ubits-display-d4-regular`, `ubits-display-d4-semibold`, `ubits-display-d4-bold`

**Headings (ONLY TWO):**
- `ubits-heading-h1` (24px)
- `ubits-heading-h2` (20px)

**Body:**
- `ubits-body-md-regular`, `ubits-body-md-semibold`, `ubits-body-md-bold` (16px)
- `ubits-body-sm-regular`, `ubits-body-sm-semibold`, `ubits-body-sm-bold` (14px)

### ❌ PROHIBITED Typography Classes:
- `ubits-h1`, `ubits-h2`, `ubits-h3`, `ubits-h4`, `ubits-h5`, `ubits-h6`
- `ubits-title`, `ubits-subtitle`, `ubits-text`, `ubits-paragraph`
- `ubits-label`, `ubits-caption`

**NEVER invent typography classes that don't exist!**

## 🔴 VALIDATION WORKFLOW

### Before Every Code Generation:
1. Check `.ubits/component-inventory.json` for existing components
2. If component exists → USE IT (never create custom)
3. If component doesn't exist → Create as new add-on and update inventory

### After Code Generation:
1. Run `npm run validate` to check for issues
2. Fix any errors before committing
3. Ensure all components import their CSS

## 📝 EXAMPLES

### ✅ CORRECT:
```html
<!-- Using official component -->
<script>
window.createButton({
  variant: 'primary',
  size: 'md',
  label: 'Click me'
});
</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="packages/addons/button/src/styles/button.css">
```

```css
/* Using UBITS tokens */
.my-element {
  color: var(--ubits-fg-1-high);
  background: var(--ubits-bg-1);
  border: 1px solid var(--ubits-border-1);
}
```

```html
<!-- Using official typography -->
<h2 class="ubits-heading-h1">Title</h2>
<p class="ubits-body-md-regular">Description</p>
```

### ❌ INCORRECT:
```html
<!-- Creating custom component when official exists -->
<button class="my-custom-button">Click</button>
```

```css
/* Using hardcoded colors */
.my-element {
  color: #000000;
  background: white;
}
```

```html
<!-- Using invented typography class -->
<h1 class="ubits-h1">Title</h1>
```

## 🚀 QUICK REFERENCE

- **Component Inventory:** `.ubits/component-inventory.json`
- **Validation Rules:** `.ubits/validation-rules.md`
- **Validation Script:** `scripts/validate-ubits.js`
- **Run Validation:** `npm run validate`

## ⚠️ CRITICAL RULES

1. **NEVER** create components without checking the inventory first
2. **NEVER** use hardcoded colors - ALWAYS use tokens
3. **NEVER** invent typography classes - ONLY use official ones
4. **ALWAYS** import component CSS when using components
5. **ALWAYS** update inventory when creating new components

**This system prevents duplicate components and ensures UBITS standards compliance.**

